	(text "HEADPHONE DISCONNECT - WIP / HOLD\nK1: G6K-2F-Y DC3 nonlatching DPDT; coil 1 (+), 8 (-).\nCOM 3/6 from U34; NO 4/5 to future jack. NC 2/7 intentionally unused.\nQ4/R116/D13: low-side driver, default-off bias and drain-source TVS draft.\nCoil supply and independent DC/rail fault gating NOT implemented.\nQualify hot clamp, coil energy, pickup/release and contact resistance.\nInputs, audio rails, jack and balanced output remain open.\nSee design/audio_relay_drive.md and audio_review.md AUD-021."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 55.88 157.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2a6dc5d7-a171-4580-923b-236b223913ce")
	)
	(text "QUIET +/-5V DECOUPLING - WIP / HOLD\nC126/C127: 100n ceramic close to U34 supply pins (TI requirement).\nC128/C129: KEMET T521B106M016ATE100, 10u/16V polymer bulk.\nC128 (+) to VPOS; C129 (+) to GND, (-) to VNEG.\n10u is a design allocation; qualify regulator stability, startup,\nreverse voltage, ripple and rail transients before release.\n125C recommended DC limit 9.6V; not for +/-14V power bank.\nSee design/audio_quiet_decoupling.md; footprints deferred."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 322.58 136.398 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify right top)
		)
		(uuid "a8e7b801-9cde-4faf-b8af-e6d82251ae45")
	)
	(text "USB-C DESKTOP DAC / POWER REQUIREMENTS - WIP\nOne cable to host: USB-HS audio data + authorized host power.\nNegotiate offered PD; headphone capability follows source budget.\nPlayback first; charge battery only from available surplus.\nFull battery: charging OFF; avoid repeated discharge/charge cycling.\nWeak host: reduce rails/output and charging; no assumed high-power PD.\nPortable demanding headphones: greater battery drain, bounded output.\nWet/fault/PD loss: independent hardware inhibit and safe disconnect.\nSeparate quiet IEM, power-headphone and proper line-output paths.\nU34/K1 remains an incomplete quiet SE draft, not desktop power/protection.\nSee design/audio_work_plan.md and audio_architecture_selection.md.\nNo continuous power, runtime or water-resistance rating established."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
