		(property "Selection_Basis" "Audio auxiliary enable series resistor: U37 Y pin4 to AUDIO_AUX_EN (U36 EN14, R117 pulldown, U38 RESET6 clamp). YAGEO RC0603FR-0710KL, 10k 1%, +/-100ppm/C. With R117 and 0.45uA EN+RESET leakage: EN >=1.1738V high (U37 VOH 2.4V test) and <=0.2317V low, vs TI 0.83V rising max / 0.67V falling min. Clamp sink <=0.3464mA, inside TPS3890 0.4mA VOL=0.25V test. No MCU_RESET_N load. Startup/collapse transients open; see design/audio_auxiliary_5v.md. Footprint deferred."
			(at 342.9 256.54 0)
