		(property "Procurement_Status" "WIP candidate; all six pins wired (SYS_AON VDD/MR with C142, R124/R125 SENSE, C143 CT, RESET on AUDIO_AUX_EN). TI Active and DigiKey CT MOQ1 snapshot 2026-10-05, unreserved, recheck before order; transient qualification open; footprint deferred."
