			)
		)
		(property "Selection_Basis" "Audio supply-valid clamp. DSE: SENSE1 GND2 MR3 VDD4 CT5 RESET6. VDD4/MR3 on SYS_AON with C142 bypass (1.5..5.5V recommended). SENSE monitors +3V3_MCU via R124/R125 (falling 3.000823..3.094473V); CT C143 1n. Open-drain RESET6 clamps AUDIO_AUX_EN directly while U37 drives through R123: sink <=0.3464mA, VOL <=0.25V at 0.4mA vs U36 EN 0.67V falling min. No MCU_RESET_N load. SYS_AON source, startup/collapse and VDD<1.5V behavior open; see design/audio_auxiliary_5v.md. Footprint deferred."
			(at 369.57 290.83 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
