		(property "Selection_Basis" "Audio auxiliary request pulldown: U37 IN1 pin1 and AUDIO_AUX_REQ from U1 P107/N5 (VCC2-domain GPIO output) to GND. YAGEO RC0603FR-0710KL, 10k 1%, +/-100ppm/C. Holds IN1 <=61.2mV while P107 is Hi-Z after reset (1uA ITSI + 5uA U37 II at 10201ohm), 0.836V below interpolated VT- min. GPIO-high load <=0.3512mA vs RA8P1 1mA VOH test. Keep P107 internal pull-up disabled. Not startup/brownout protection; see design/audio_auxiliary_5v.md. Footprint deferred."
			(at 250.19 231.14 0)
